{"_id":"69712b6a03b48b900bf6dc5c","roadmapSlug":"mlops","nodeId":"QEayqA8zYsJn0rQYz-4zv","description":"# Kubeflow\n\nKubeflow is an open-source machine learning platform designed to simplify the deployment and management of ML workflows on Kubernetes. It provides tools and components for building, training, and deploying machine learning models, allowing users to create portable and scalable ML pipelines. Kubeflow aims to make it easier for data scientists and engineers to leverage Kubernetes for their machine learning projects, handling tasks like resource management, model serving, and pipeline orchestration.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Kubeflow","url":"https://www.kubeflow.org/","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa640"},{"type":"opensource","title":"kubeflow","url":"https://github.com/kubeflow/kubeflow","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa641"},{"type":"article","title":"What is Kubeflow?","url":"https://cloud.google.com/discover/what-is-kubeflow?hl=en","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa642"},{"type":"article","title":"Tutorial ΓÇô Basic Kubeflow Pipeline From Scratch","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/tutorial-basic-kubeflow-pipeline-from-scratch-5f0350dc1905/?utm_source=roadmap&utm_medium=Referral&utm_campaign=TDS+roadmap+integration","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa643"},{"type":"video","title":"Kubeflow Explained for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hvzEPlRdJ2Q","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa644"},{"type":"video","title":"Intro to Kubeflow Pipelines","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_AY8mmbR1o4&list=PLIivdWyY5sqLS4lN75RPDEyBgTro_YX7x","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa645"}],"createdAt":"2026-01-21T19:39:22.404Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:05:22.994Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04168aa","title":"DataCamp - MLOps Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/L0Ynzo"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/mlops/content/QEayqA8zYsJn0rQYz